OL,3,GNEWSATeam with a head for heights keeps
OL,4,Acathedral safe from lightning
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Even though you've done it a number of
OL,7,Ftimes before, you still get a bit of a
OL,8,Fbuzz from it."
